---
description: Deploy scripts, VPS runbooks and CI workflows of this fork; routes to the docs/ runbooks
globs: apps/deploy/**,.github/workflows/**,.github/actions/**,docs/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Before editing, read `docs/branching.md` (branch roles, CI triggers, protection) and the runbook
for the area: `docs/vps-bootstrap.md` (host setup, paths, units), `docs/multi-realm.md` (live vs
test), `docs/build-runners.md` (runner labels, `pick-runner`), `docs/recovery.md` (backups).
`apps/deploy/README.md` tables every script. Paths, ports, unit names and runner labels in the
workflows must stay in sync with those docs; update both in the same change. New fork docs go in
`docs/` with a row in `docs/README.md`.
